    "Read all five complete panels and four test files. First-party React/TypeScript, mock controllers and synthetic room/member/transcript fixtures. No credentials, real media, runtime profiles, third-party assets or private history exported.",
    "Room creation defaults to two-person voice. Additional three-person profiles remain developer evaluation and explicitly label the missing group voice bridge. UI choice does not replace backend admission.",
